cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FinAgent in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "FinAgent: multi-agent equity research on a small NVIDIA Nemotron model"
abstract: >-
  A teaching project for agentic AI that runs on a CPU. A team of LangGraph agents on NVIDIA
  Nemotron 3 Nano 4B researches public companies with deterministic data tools (SEC EDGAR XBRL
  filings, market prices, US Treasury rates and 10-K passages). A rule-based fact-checker traces
  every number to the tool output it came from and checks that each cited claim keeps its
  source's company, period and metric, and an evaluation harness measures the system with
  ablations. It comes with a two-hour hands-on lab, including exercises on what the checks miss.
